WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:06.906 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Tucker: GOOD EVENING AND

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:07.540 line:78%
WELCOME TO

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:09.642 line:78%
"TUCKER CARLSON TONIGHT."

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:11.277 line:78%
IT WAS A WEEK AGO TODAY THAT A

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:14.681 line:78%
DERANGED TEENAGER MURDERED 19

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:15.548 line:78%
CHILDREN AND TWO TEACHERS IN

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:16.282 line:78%
ELEMENTARY SCHOOL IN TEXAS.

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:19.185 line:78%
YOU KNOW THIS BECAUSE WE'VE HAD

00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:21.388 line:78%
SEVEN DAYS OF FULL SATURATION

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:22.956 line:78%
COVERAGE AND IT'S ALL DESERVED.

00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:23.790 line:78%
GIVEN THAT, IT'S AMAZING WHAT WE

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:25.759 line:78%
STILL DON'T KNOW ABOUT WHAT

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:26.793 line:78%
HAPPENED THAT DAY.

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:28.128 line:78%
LET'S START, JUST BECAUSE OF THE

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:29.229 line:78%
MOST OBVIOUS, WITH HOW THE

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:32.899 line:78%
SHOOTER COULD POSSIBLY HAVE

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:34.968 line:78%
AFFORDED THE FIREARMS HE USED.

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:35.935 line:78%
HE WAS 18 YEARS OLD, HE WORKED

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:38.138 line:78%
PART-TIME AT THE DRIVE-THROUGH

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:40.607 line:78%
AT A LOCAL WENDY'S, YET POLICE

00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:41.875 line:78%
SAID HE HAD AT LEAST $4,000 OF

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:46.279 line:78%
BRAND-NEW WEAPONS, INCLUDING TWO

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:48.081 line:78%
AR-15 RIFLES, 1600 ROUNDS OF

00:00:46.613 --> 00:00:50.350 line:78%
.556 AMMUNITION, A BALLISTIC

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:51.751 line:78%
VEST, AND 60 MAGAZINES.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:54.387 line:78%
ONE OF HIS RIVALS WAS A HIGH-END

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:55.388 line:78%
MODEL MANUFACTURED BY A COMPANY

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:57.123 line:78%
CALLED DANIEL DEFENSE.

00:00:55.488 --> 00:00:58.792 line:78%
ACCORDING TO A RECEIPT THAT HE

00:00:57.424 --> 00:01:01.761 line:78%
POSTED IN PRIVATE MESSAGE, THAT

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:02.295 line:78%
GUN COST $2,000 AND HE PAID IN

00:01:02.095 --> 00:01:03.730 line:78%
FULL.

00:01:02.429 --> 00:01:06.199 line:78%
HE COULD HAVE BOUGHT EFFECTIVELY

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:08.168 line:78%
THE VERY SAME RIFLE AT ANY ONE

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:08.968 line:78%
STORE FOR A THIRD OF THE COST.

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:10.503 line:78%
BUT APPARENTLY TO HIM, PRICE WAS

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:12.605 line:78%
NO OBJECT.

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:13.907 line:78%
THAT'S PRETTY WEIRD.

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:16.076 line:78%
IF POLICE KNOW WHERE HE GOT THE

00:01:14.007 --> 00:01:17.177 line:78%
MONEY TO BUY ONE OF THE MOST

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:18.845 line:78%
EXPENSIVE AR-15s ON THE

00:01:17.277 --> 00:01:19.779 line:78%
MARKET, THEY ARE NOT TELLING US.

00:01:18.945 --> 00:01:21.915 line:78%
NOR FOR THAT MATTER HAVE THEY

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:23.316 line:78%
EXPLAINED WHY THEY LIED ABOUT

00:01:22.015 --> 00:01:23.783 line:78%
THE MOST BASIC FACTS OF THE

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.118 line:78%
SHOOTING.

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:27.187 line:78%
FOR THE FIRST 24 HOURS THEY TOLD

00:01:25.218 --> 00:01:28.888 line:78%
US THAT A SCHOOL RESOURCE

00:01:27.287 --> 00:01:30.723 line:78%
OFFICER FIRED AT THE GOVERNMENT.

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:31.558 line:78%
HE "ENGAGED."

00:01:30.857 --> 00:01:33.460 line:78%
BUT THEY MUST'VE KNOWN AT THE

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:33.960 line:78%
TIME THEY SAID IT THAT THAT WAS

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:35.428 line:78%
NOT TRUE.

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:37.063 line:78%
THEY MUST KNOW THE RESOURCE

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:39.532 line:78%
OFFICER WAS NOT EVEN AT THE

00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:40.567 line:78%
SCHOOL WHEN HE ARRIVED.

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:41.968 line:78%
BUT THEY TOLD US OTHERWISE.

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:43.002 line:78%
WHY DID THEY DO THAT?

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:45.438 line:78%
AND BY THE WAY, HOW LONG WAS HE

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:47.340 line:78%
OUTSIDE THE SCHOOL FIRING HIS

00:01:45.538 --> 00:01:48.074 line:78%
GUN AT PEOPLE AT A NEARBY

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:50.310 line:78%
FUNERAL HOME BEFORE HE WENT

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:51.744 line:78%
INSIDE AND KILLED CHILDREN?

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:53.379 line:78%
IT SEEMS LIKE A FAIRLY SIMPLE

00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:53.746 line:78%
QUESTION, CERTAINLY AN IMPORTANT

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:55.415 line:78%
QUESTION.

00:01:53.847 --> 00:01:57.350 line:78%
LAST WEEK AUTHORITIES TOLD US

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:58.251 line:78%
THAT HE WAS OUTSIDE THE SCHOOL

00:01:57.784 --> 00:02:01.020 line:78%
FOR 10-12 MINUTES.

00:01:58.351 --> 00:02:02.088 line:78%
HERE'S THE CLAIM.

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:07.594 line:78%
&gt;&gt; WE GOT A CRASH AND A MAN WITH

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:08.461 line:78%
A GUN.

00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:08.995 line:78%
AND WE HAVE RESPONDING OFFICERS.

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:13.766 line:78%
THAT'S WHAT IT IS.

00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:14.634 line:78%
IF IT'S 12 MINUTES FROM 11:30

00:02:13.867 --> 00:02:18.004 line:78%
211:40, THAT'S THE INFORMATION

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:19.038 line:78%
WE HAVE.

00:02:18.104 --> 00:02:22.175 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Tucker: 12 MINUTES FROM

00:02:19.139 --> 00:02:24.144 line:78%
11:30 TO 11:40.

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:26.613 line:78%
THAT'S THE INFORMATION WE HAVE.

00:02:24.244 --> 00:02:27.547 line:78%
BUT THAT INFORMATION IS CLEARLY

00:02:26.779 --> 00:02:29.983 line:78%
WRONG BECAUSE 11:30 TO 11:40 IS

00:02:27.647 --> 00:02:31.017 line:78%
NOT 10 MINUTES.

00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:32.719 line:78%
THE TIMELINE MATTERS, SO WHAT'S

00:02:31.117 --> 00:02:34.687 line:78%
THE REAL TIMELINE?

00:02:33.219 --> 00:02:36.723 line:78%
ON FRIDAY, THE DIRECTOR OF TEXAS

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:37.090 line:78%
DPS CAME UP WITH A BRAND-NEW

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:39.125 line:78%
TIMELINE.

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:40.660 line:78%
HERE IT IS.

00:02:40.026 --> 00:02:42.629 line:78%
&gt;&gt; 11:20TH, THE SUSPECT VEHICLE

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:44.430 line:78%
CRASHES INTO THE DITCH AS

00:02:42.729 --> 00:02:47.400 line:78%
PREVIOUSLY DESCRIBED.

00:02:44.531 --> 00:02:48.134 line:78%
THE TEACHER RUNS TO THE ROOM,

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:50.170 line:78%
132, TO RETRIEVE THE PHONE AND

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:51.104 line:78%
THAT SAME TEACHER WALKS BACK TO

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:53.873 line:78%
THE EXIT DOOR AT THE DOOR

00:02:51.204 --> 00:02:54.741 line:78%
REMAINS PROPPED OPEN.

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:59.078 line:78%
11:33, THE SUSPECT BEGINS

00:02:54.841 --> 00:03:00.146 line:78%
SHOOTING AT ROOM 111, OR 112,

00:02:59.179 --> 00:03:00.914 line:78%
IT'S NOT POSSIBLE TO DETERMINE

00:03:00.246 --> 00:03:04.417 line:78%
FROM THE VIDEO ANGLE THAT WE HAD

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:06.286 line:78%
AT THIS POINT IN TIME.

00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:07.587 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SO ACTUALLY -- AND

00:03:06.386 --> 00:03:09.122 line:78%
THAT WAS THE DIRECTOR OF PUBLIC

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:11.691 line:78%
SAFETY IN TEXAS -- IT WAS ONLY E

00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:11.991 line:78%
SHOOTING AT PEOPLE.

00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:13.393 line:78%
OKAY.

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:13.960 line:78%
BUT HERE'S THE KEY TAKE AWAY

00:03:13.493 --> 00:03:16.129 line:78%
FROM THAT STATEMENT.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.896 line:78%
HERE'S WHAT THEY WANT YOU TO

00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:18.798 line:78%
BELIEVE.

00:03:16.996 --> 00:03:20.366 line:78%
THE BACKDOOR TO THE SCHOOL WAS

00:03:18.898 --> 00:03:22.168 line:78%
OPEN BECAUSE A TEACHER AT THE

00:03:20.466 --> 00:03:23.903 line:78%
SCHOOL LEFT IT OPEN AFTER GOING

00:03:22.268 --> 00:03:24.671 line:78%
OUTSIDE TO RETRIEVE A PHONE.

00:03:24.003 --> 00:03:26.539 line:78%
SO IT'S THE TEACHER'S FAULT THAT

00:03:24.771 --> 00:03:27.140 line:78%
HE WAS ABLE TO GET INSIDE.

00:03:26.639 --> 00:03:29.142 line:78%
THAT'S WHAT THEY SAID.

00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:31.911 line:78%
ON FRIDAY.

00:03:29.242 --> 00:03:32.779 line:78%
BUT THIS TOO APPEARS TO BE

00:03:32.011 --> 00:03:33.746 line:78%
UNTRUE.

00:03:33.179 --> 00:03:34.314 line:78%
THE "HOUSTON CHRONICLE" IS

00:03:33.846 --> 00:03:35.715 line:78%
REPORTING TONIGHT THAT

00:03:34.414 --> 00:03:36.416 line:78%
SURVEILLANCE FOOTAGE OF THE

00:03:35.815 --> 00:03:38.985 line:78%
SCHOOL SHOWS THAT THE TEACHER

00:03:36.516 --> 00:03:39.719 line:78%
SLAMMED THE DOOR AFTER RUNNING

00:03:39.085 --> 00:03:41.921 line:78%
BACK INSIDE AND OF COURSE THAT

00:03:39.819 --> 00:03:44.824 line:78%
WOULD MAKE SENSE SINCE BY THIS

00:03:42.021 --> 00:03:45.558 line:78%
POINT HE WAS FIRING HIS RIFLE,

00:03:44.924 --> 00:03:47.760 line:78%
AND THAT SAME TEACHER WAS USING

00:03:45.658 --> 00:03:49.562 line:78%
THE PHONE IN QUESTION TO MAKE A

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:51.698 line:78%
PANICKED CALL TO 911.

00:03:49.662 --> 00:03:52.465 line:78%
NO ONE DISPUTES THAT.

00:03:51.831 --> 00:03:54.601 line:78%
SO WHY DID THE AUTHORITIES TELL

00:03:53.766 --> 00:03:56.970 line:78%
US OTHERWISE?

00:03:54.801 --> 00:03:58.972 line:78%
AND FOR THAT MATTER, WHY DID

00:03:57.103 --> 00:04:00.106 line:78%
THEY INITIALLY DENIED THAT THE

00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:01.541 line:78%
ON SCENE POLICE COMMANDER

00:04:00.206 --> 00:04:02.775 line:78%
ORDERED COPS TO STAND DOWN AND

00:04:01.641 --> 00:04:05.211 line:78%
REMAIN OUTSIDE HIS CHILDREN WERE

00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:06.980 line:78%
BEING SHOT DEAD INSIDE THE

00:04:05.545 --> 00:04:08.481 line:78%
SCHOOL?

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:11.150 line:78%
ON THURSDAY, A SPOKESMAN FOR

00:04:08.581 --> 00:04:12.118 line:78%
TEXAS DPS CALLED THAT ACCOUNT A

00:04:11.251 --> 00:04:14.120 line:78%
RUMOR, BUT THERE WAS A VIDEOTAPE

00:04:12.218 --> 00:04:14.754 line:78%
TO SHOW THAT IT WAS TRUE, IT

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:17.357 line:78%
ACTUALLY HAPPEN.

00:04:14.854 --> 00:04:18.691 line:78%
SO THE NEXT DAY, FORCED BY THE

00:04:17.457 --> 00:04:20.960 line:78%
VIDEOTAPE, TEXAS DPS ADMITTED

00:04:18.791 --> 00:04:29.535 line:78%
THE RUMORS WERE TRUE.

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:30.503 line:78%
WATCH.

00:04:30.003 --> 00:04:33.172 line:78%
&gt;&gt; NONE AT THAT TIME.

00:04:31.104 --> 00:04:35.541 line:78%
&gt;&gt; WHY?

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:36.209 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THE ON SCENE COMMANDER AT THE

00:04:35.642 --> 00:04:38.077 line:78%
TIME BELIEVED THAT IT HAD

00:04:36.309 --> 00:04:42.382 line:78%
TRANSITIONED FROM AN ACTIVE

00:04:38.177 --> 00:04:53.092 line:78%
SHOOTER TO A BARRICADED SUBJECT.

00:04:42.482 --> 00:04:53.092 line:78%
&gt;&gt; [INDISCERNIBLE].

00:04:55.895 --> 00:05:00.099 line:78%
&gt;&gt; WE ARE WELL AWARE OF THAT.

00:04:59.465 --> 00:05:02.769 line:78%
OBVIOUSLY, YOU KNOW, BASED UPON

00:05:00.199 --> 00:05:03.536 line:78%
THE INFORMATION WE HAVE, THERE

00:05:02.869 --> 00:05:05.171 line:78%
WEREN'T CHILDREN IN THAT CLASS

00:05:03.636 --> 00:05:07.173 line:78%
AND THAT WHERE RISK AND IT WAS

00:05:05.271 --> 00:05:07.840 line:78%
IN FACT STILL AN ACTIVE SHOOTER

00:05:07.273 --> 00:05:09.842 line:78%
IN THAT SITUATION AND NOT A

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:10.543 line:78%
BARRICADED SUBJECT.

00:05:09.942 --> 00:05:12.879 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BUT THAT'S NOT

00:05:10.643 --> 00:05:14.113 line:78%
REALLY AN EXCELLENT NATION OF

00:05:12.979 --> 00:05:14.947 line:78%
COURSE, BECAUSE NO ONE DISPUTES

00:05:14.213 --> 00:05:18.351 line:78%
THAT EVERYONE ON THE SCENE,

00:05:15.048 --> 00:05:20.086 line:78%
INCLUDING POLICE, KNEW THAT HE

00:05:18.451 --> 00:05:22.555 line:78%
HAD WEAPONS, WAS FIRING THEM AT

00:05:20.186 --> 00:05:26.159 line:78%
PEOPLE TO KILL PEOPLE AND WAS

00:05:22.655 --> 00:05:28.761 line:78%
INSIDE THE SCHOOL WITH CHILDREN.

00:05:26.259 --> 00:05:30.963 line:78%
NO ONE DISPUTES THAT.

00:05:28.861 --> 00:05:32.498 line:78%
SO WHY DID HEAVILY ARMED POLICE

00:05:31.064 --> 00:05:36.536 line:78%
UNITS DECIDE NOT TO STOP A

00:05:32.598 --> 00:05:38.404 line:78%
SAILBOAT OR EXECUTING CHILDREN?

00:05:36.636 --> 00:05:43.176 line:78%
IF NOT FINGER POINTING TO ASK

00:05:38.504 --> 00:05:44.644 line:78%
THAT QUESTION, THESE ARE COMP

00:05:43.276 --> 00:05:45.078 line:78%
LOCATED CIRCUMSTANCES AND PEOPLE

00:05:44.744 --> 00:05:48.781 line:78%
MAKE MISTAKES.

00:05:45.178 --> 00:05:49.549 line:78%
BUT WE ARE MAKING LONG-TERM POLY

00:05:48.881 --> 00:05:52.151 line:78%
DECISIONS BASED ON THE DECISIONS

00:05:49.649 --> 00:05:54.120 line:78%
THAT HAPPENED LAST WEEK IN

00:05:52.452 --> 00:05:55.521 line:78%
UVALDE.

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:56.189 line:78%
POLITICIANS ARE CALLING FOR

00:05:55.621 --> 00:05:58.925 line:78%
MILITARIZING AMERICA'S ENTRY

00:05:56.289 --> 00:06:00.393 line:78%
SCHOOLS AND GET THEY CAN'T

00:05:59.025 --> 00:06:02.195 line:78%
ANSWER WHAT THE MILITARY FORCE

00:06:00.493 --> 00:06:03.029 line:78%
EFFECTIVELY OUTSIDE THIS

00:06:02.295 --> 00:06:06.199 line:78%
ELEMENTARY SCHOOL REFUSED TO

00:06:03.129 --> 00:06:07.667 line:78%
STOP THE KILLING.

00:06:06.299 --> 00:06:08.701 line:78%
SO THIS MASSACRE COULD HAVE BEEN

00:06:07.767 --> 00:06:10.136 line:78%
PREVENTED AT SOME POINT.

00:06:09.168 --> 00:06:10.770 line:78%
IT WAS NOT PREVENTED.

00:06:10.236 --> 00:06:11.938 line:78%
WHY WAS THAT?

00:06:11.371 --> 00:06:14.474 line:78%
WE SHOULD KNOW THE ANSWER.

00:06:12.038 --> 00:06:15.308 line:78%
BUT DON'T HOLD YOUR BREATH.

00:06:14.574 --> 00:06:17.543 line:78%
NO ONE IN POWER SEEMS ANXIOUS TO

00:06:15.408 --> 00:06:20.213 line:78%
HOLD THEMSELVES ACCOUNTABLE FOR

00:06:17.643 --> 00:06:21.547 line:78%
WHAT HAPPENED IN UVALDE.

00:06:20.313 --> 00:06:22.615 line:78%
AND AMAZINGLY -- AND THIS IS SO

00:06:21.647 --> 00:06:24.784 line:78%
PERVERSE IT'S HARD TO BELIEVE

00:06:22.849 --> 00:06:26.018 line:78%
IT'S TRUE, BUT IT IS -- SOME

00:06:24.884 --> 00:06:28.588 line:78%
SEEM DETERMINED TO MAKE FUTURE

00:06:26.119 --> 00:06:29.622 line:78%
SCHOOL SHOOTINGS MORE LIKELY.

00:06:28.855 --> 00:06:31.858 line:78%
IN CALIFORNIA, THE STATE

00:06:29.722 --> 00:06:33.292 line:78%
ASSEMBLY JUST VOTED TO END THE

00:06:31.958 --> 00:06:33.993 line:78%
REQUIREMENT, THE LONG-STANDING

00:06:33.393 --> 00:06:36.929 line:78%
REQUIREMENT THAT WAS PUT IN

00:06:34.093 --> 00:06:38.131 line:78%
PLACE AFTER SCHOOL SHOOTINGS,

00:06:37.029 --> 00:06:39.132 line:78%
THAT SCHOOLS ALERT

00:06:38.231 --> 00:06:40.400 line:78%
LAW ENFORCEMENT WHEN STUDENTS

00:06:39.232 --> 00:06:41.868 line:78%
"ATTACK, SALT, OR PHYSICALLY

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:44.737 line:78%
THREATEN SCHOOL OFFICIALS."

00:06:41.968 --> 00:06:45.938 line:78%
THAT'S NO LONGER IN PLACE, AND

00:06:44.837 --> 00:06:47.807 line:78%
ACCORDING TO THE DEMOCRATIC

00:06:46.038 --> 00:06:48.574 line:78%
PARTY, THAT'S A WIN FOR EQUITY.

00:06:47.974 --> 00:06:51.077 line:78%
IF WE KNOW THIS BECAUSE THE

00:06:48.674 --> 00:06:52.078 line:78%
SPONSOR OF THE BILL, A

00:06:51.177 --> 00:06:52.745 line:78%
CALIFORNIA STATE SENATOR,

00:06:52.178 --> 00:06:53.679 line:78%
STEPHEN BRADFORD, SAID SO.

00:06:52.845 --> 00:06:56.582 line:78%
HERE'S WHAT HE TOLD

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:58.084 line:78%
"THE DAILY CALLER."

00:06:56.749 --> 00:07:00.186 line:78%
"BLACK STUDENTS, LATINX COLORS,

00:06:58.184 --> 00:07:01.154 line:78%
STUDENTS OF COLOR AND STUDENT OF

00:07:00.286 --> 00:07:02.588 line:78%
DISABILITY'S ARE

00:07:01.587 --> 00:07:03.256 line:78%
DISPROPORTIONATELY REFERRED TO

00:07:02.688 --> 00:07:03.623 line:78%
LAW-ENFORCEMENT, CITED, AND

00:07:03.356 --> 00:07:07.193 line:78%
ARRESTED."

00:07:04.924 --> 00:07:10.463 line:78%
SO TOO MANY LATINX STUDENTS IN

00:07:07.293 --> 00:07:12.565 line:78%
WHEELCHAIRS ARE APPARENTLY BEING

00:07:10.563 --> 00:07:13.566 line:78%
BLAMED FOR SCHOOL SHOOTING SO

00:07:12.665 --> 00:07:15.201 line:78%
THERE IS NO MORE VIOLENCE IN

00:07:13.666 --> 00:07:16.102 line:78%
CALIFORNIA SCHOOL'S AT ALL.

00:07:15.301 --> 00:07:19.472 line:78%
HOW DOES THAT HELP PREVENT THE

00:07:16.202 --> 00:07:20.106 line:78%
NEXT SCHOOL SHOOTING?

00:07:19.572 --> 00:07:21.441 line:78%
IT DOESN'T.

00:07:20.206 --> 00:07:22.175 line:78%
BUT IT STARTS TO SING WITH

00:07:21.541 --> 00:07:24.477 line:78%
HELPING PREVENT SCHOOL SHOOTINGS

00:07:22.275 --> 00:07:26.679 line:78%
IS NOT REALLY THE POINT OF THIS

00:07:24.577 --> 00:07:27.079 line:78%
EXERCISE, AMASSING MORE POWER IS

00:07:26.779 --> 00:07:28.214 line:78%
THE POINT.

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:30.950 line:78%
AND WE KNOW THIS FROM WHAT'S

00:07:28.314 --> 00:07:31.551 line:78%
HAPPENING NORTH OF US.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:33.085 line:78%
CANADA'S BOTOX DICTATOR

00:07:31.651 --> 00:07:35.188 line:78%
JUSTIN TRUDEAU WASTED NO TIME

00:07:33.186 --> 00:07:36.722 line:78%
USING THE TRAGEDY IN THE U.S. TO

